// The moonorm data layer mctl generates from greet.api's `type User` block: the
// model struct, a `user_model` (declared columns, a Row decoder, and the INSERT
// projection reflection can't synthesise), a `user_table` descriptor, and an
// up/down migration pair. Regenerated by `moon run gen`; committed so the repo
// shows what mctl emits. Compiles against the published moonorm + moondb.
import {
  "Lfan-ke/moonorm",
  "Lfan-ke/moondb",
}
